@startuml C2_Resource_Usage_Logical
title C2 – Resource Usage (Logical Containers)
left to right direction

node "Client Browser" as Browser {
  component "Resource Utilization SPA" as Spa
}

node "PLMS Backend" as Backend {
  component "TodoApi" as TodoApi
}

node "OEM Platform" as Oem {
  component "OEM API" as OemApi
  database "Operations DB" as OpsDb
}

node "IAM" as Iam

Spa --> TodoApi : HTTPS JSON
TodoApi --> Iam : Token validation (OAuth)
TodoApi --> OemApi : HTTPS (resource usage)
OemApi --> OpsDb : Aggregate saved plans
OemApi --> TodoApi : Usage summary
TodoApi --> Spa : Usage summary + warnings
Spa --> Browser : Render table / chart

@enduml
